 Bend. This was just the beginning of their expansion into the Indiana market, as they later acquired Mutton Power Equipment in Fort Wayne in early 2023. </p><p class="sc-edLa-Dd hZPWCc pf-97_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">In July&nbsp;2023, Russo joined both Fort Wayne&nbsp;teams (C&amp;C and Mutton) under the Russo Power Equipment name&nbsp;at&nbsp;their newly established Fort Wayne location (the former Mutton facility) on Illinois Rd. <br><br>These two experienced dealerships have built a loyal and diverse customer base over many decades, and now, under the Russo brand, they will offer their customers an even more enriching experience, with an extensive range of top-quality products and services.  </p><p class="sc-edLa-Dd hZPWCc pf-99_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">While the C&amp;C Fort Wayne location officially&nbsp;closed its doors on July 28, 2023, and&nbsp;the C&amp;C South Bend location closed it's doors on December 29, 2023, we hope to be back in South Bend soon!<br></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:4;--c-md:4;--c-lg:4"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fatbYi lnCFtg pf-101_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-cXPBhi kkWDYP pf-102_ pf-heading-7-h3">"It is exciting to have two long time Fort Wayne businesses (C&amp;C Distributors &amp; Mutton Power Equipment)
